I walk over to a ticket machine on the street.
First my travel card needs more money.
I take my travel card out of my bag.
It is a small, blue card.
I place the card on the machine's screen.
The screen shows my balance.
The balance is too low for a long trip.
I tap on the screen.
I choose an amount.
I pay two hundred kroner with my payment card.
The machine writes "Approved" on the screen.
Now I have money on the card.
I put the card back in the bag.
I am ready for the long trip.
Now I need to take the bus.
I walk over to the bus stop.
